OL,3,GNEWSAResidents demand action over road
OL,4,Aclosed since Goretti
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents are demanding action to
OL,7,Frepair and reopen a road that has been
OL,8,Fclosed for nearly nine months.
OL,10,FLittle Polgooth road near St Austell
OL,11,Fwas shut following Storm Goretti in
OL,12,FJanuary when an embankment collapsed
OL,13,Fand a tree fell on to a lane.
OL,15,FJulie Cunningham, the Reform UK
OL,16,Fcouncillor for St Mewan and Grampound,
OL,17,Fsaid it had caused "upheaval" with
OL,18,Flocals tired of the "endless gridlock".
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
