OL,3,GNEWSAResidents demand action over road
OL,4,Aclosed since Goretti
OL,5,
OL,6,FCornwall Council said the damage had
OL,7,Fled to a complex repair job, which they
OL,8,Fhave "prioritised" this year - and they
OL,9,Fare now "progressing the final design".
